{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "漢譯校者按：日譯本作九百三十．依下合計文及實數應作九百三十一。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "漢譯校者按：日譯本作二百九十．依下合計文及實數應作二百九十四。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋順終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋逆終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋順逆終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋逆順終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "漢譯校者按：本文中意譯作「闖竊」。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "漢譯校者按：本文中意譯作「入家襲掠」。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "漢譯校者按：本文中缺譯「邀掠」二字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "漢譯者按：日譯本作「七」．今改正。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "漢譯者按：此處「除非食緣」．原譯無非字．今補之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0414001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0414001", "type": "orig", "text": "以下隨用 paṭṭhāna 之音譯。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0414002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0414002", "type": "orig", "text": "此處將 paṭṭhāna 之語義作 pa 及 ṭhāna 之合成觀。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0414003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0414003", "type": "orig", "text": "處非處善巧性 ṭhānāṭhāṇa-kusalatā 之處（ṭhāna）乃為緣（paccaya）之義也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0414004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0414004", "type": "orig", "text": "發趣 paṭṭhāna．乃為與建立 paṭṭhapana 同義。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0414005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0414005", "type": "orig", "text": "發趣（paṭṭhita）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0414006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0414006", "type": "orig", "text": "進發（gamana）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0414007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0414007", "type": "orig", "text": "一切智性智（sabbaññutā-ñāṇa）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0414001-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0414001-1", "type": "orig", "text": "以下略說分之註．悉引用 visuddhi-magga 中（暹羅本卷二之百二十八頁以下）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0414002-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0414002-1", "type": "orig", "text": "「論之成分」者．宗因喻也。因者為彼之一也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0414003-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0414003-1", "type": "orig", "text": "無貪．無瞋．無癡．貪．瞋．癡也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0414004-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0414004-1", "type": "orig", "text": "「以緣故由此行」 paticca etacmāeti。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0414005-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0414005-1", "type": "orig", "text": "於阿闍梨所說之第一失。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0414006-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0414006-1", "type": "orig", "text": "本文二。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0414007-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0414007-1", "type": "orig", "text": "第二失。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0414008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0414008", "type": "orig", "text": "於無貪無瞋無癡之相應心．亦有善心．亦有異熟心．唯作心之無記心。若阿闍梨所說之因．為完成善等之性者．則於異熟心唯作心之無記心中相應之無貪無瞋無癡．不得不為無記因矣。然無貪等決為善因而非無記因．故阿闍梨之所說．為不成立云。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0414009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0414009", "type": "orig", "text": "以下立自說也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0414010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0414010", "type": "orig", "text": "「胡麻芽」云者．應是一種水草（tila-btiakādi-sevalā）之名。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0415001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0415001", "type": "orig", "text": "底本原文為 addhānantaratāya 應譯所無間．或世無間故。然無間緣唯為非色緣．則所無間不相應。又為前剎那法與後剎那法之關係．則世無間亦非。然依清淨道論英譯六三八頁．則諸本有讀作 atthānantaratāya 者．乃採之而譯此。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0415001-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0415001-1", "type": "orig", "text": "「蘊」本文作「法」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0415002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0415002", "type": "orig", "text": "如眼識等之所依為眼處等．意識之所依為心所依也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0415001-2", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0415001-2", "type": "orig", "text": "說依止 nissaya 之語義。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0415002-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0415002-1", "type": "orig", "text": "親 upa 義說為強力之義也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0415003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0415003", "type": "orig", "text": "本文五四四之文也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0415004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0415004", "type": "orig", "text": "由於原字 pakata 有所造及本性二義故依兩方解釋之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0415005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0415005", "type": "orig", "text": "本文五四四之文也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0416001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0416001", "type": "orig", "text": "本文為五七二之文也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0416001-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0416001-1", "type": "orig", "text": "本文參照五七九。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0416001-2", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0416001-2", "type": "orig", "text": "本文參照五八六。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0416002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0416002", "type": "orig", "text": "「法」字本文作「蘊」字。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0416001-3", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0416001-3", "type": "orig", "text": "為不善異熟無因五識中與身識俱之苦受．及善異熟無因五識中與身識俱之樂受也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0416002-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0416002-1", "type": "orig", "text": "參照五九三本文。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0416001-4", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0416001-4", "type": "orig", "text": "參照六〇〇本文。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0416001-5", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0416001-5", "type": "orig", "text": "本文六〇四。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0416002-2", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0416002-2", "type": "orig", "text": "本文六〇六。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0416003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0416003", "type": "orig", "text": "本文六〇六至六〇八。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0416001-6", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0416001-6", "type": "orig", "text": "本文六一一。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0417001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0417001", "type": "orig", "text": "本文七。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0417002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0417002", "type": "orig", "text": "本文四八六。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0417003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0417003", "type": "orig", "text": "「蘊」底本作「法」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0417004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0417004", "type": "orig", "text": "暹羅本雖是 asannnnokāsattā 從 PTS 本取 annnnokāsattā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0417005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0417005", "type": "orig", "text": "出緣略說分最後之註。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0418001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0418001", "type": "orig", "text": "sampayuttadhammāya tividhāya manodhātuyā 意界有三層。對於刺戟面向五官（pannca-dvārāvajjana）及二種領受（sampaticchana）也。此中向轉在五識之前．領受在其後也．以此故．非在一剎那云。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0418002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0418002", "type": "orig", "text": "pannnnatti 非實法名．概念之類也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0418003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0418003", "type": "orig", "text": "apariyāpanna 非所攝云者．同於出世間 lokuttara 不攝於三有之意也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0418001-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0418001-1", "type": "orig", "text": "「四種」者．謂欲 chanda 勤 viriya心citta 觀 vimaṁsā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0418002-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0418002-1", "type": "orig", "text": "欲界繫有因善、異熟、唯作心各有八中．與智不相應者為二因心．與智相應者為三因心。於唯作心．理趣亦同。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0418003-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0418003-1", "type": "orig", "text": "十二欲界繫不善心也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0419004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0419004", "type": "orig", "text": "從 PTS 本補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0419001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0419001", "type": "orig", "text": "異熟之意界（vipākamanodhātu）．外界之刺戟．刺戟感官或五感．先向五官而轉．謂之五門向轉（panncadvārāvajjana）。在此地位．尚未至於起何等之認識。於其次乃起眼識（cakkhu-vinnnnāṇa）乃至身識。然南方言．此五識者．僅為感任何物之極弱程度者。在次剎那乃至刺戟領受（sampaticchana）之位．至於此位領受刺戟而感少許之快與不快．此有善異熟領受及不善異熟領受之二種。在南方稱此五門向轉及二種領受為意界．稱之為三種之意界（ti-manodhātu or manodhātutika）。此位尚為前世之業報而為無意志的動作故名異熟．以其不能引起未來善惡之果報．故名無因。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0419002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0419002", "type": "orig", "text": "推度作用之無因異熟意識界（sāntiranakiccā ahetukavipākamanovinnnnānadhātu）．次於前述領受之位者為推度。由此入於意識界．至此而對於刺戟物．起尋求之作用．而生快、不快、中性之感覺．然尚未至決定為何物也。此亦如前述之為異熟而無因也。此有三種．不善異熟無因心所攝與捨俱行之推度．善異熟無因心所攝與快俱行之推度．及與捨俱行之推度。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0419003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0419003", "type": "orig", "text": "建立（votthabbana, vottppana）．意識界中之第二位．至此而決定刺戟之為何物。此亦名意門向轉．欲界無因心中．無因唯作心所攝。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0419004-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0419004-1", "type": "orig", "text": "證用（javana）．意識界中至於此位而認識達到完全地位．離前世業報之束縛而自由動作。以其由善惡之業引業果於未來故為有因。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0419005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0419005", "type": "orig", "text": "彼所緣（tadārammana）．重習證用．位之所緣也．為一心作用之結果．為異熟。經過此位．有逕沒於有分心者。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0419006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0419006", "type": "orig", "text": "有分作用（bhavangakicca）．異熟心．為成三有因之位也。為轉心未起時之心．亦得謂之潛在意識．為阿賴耶識之先驅思想。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0419007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0419007", "type": "orig", "text": "中性受相應之不善（majjhatta-vedanāsampayutto akusalo）．捨俱行之不善心也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0419008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0419008", "type": "orig", "text": "三因欲界繫異熟（tihetukakā-māvacara-vipāka）．與智相應之欲界繫異熟心也。此為無貪、無瞋、無癡相應故。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0419001-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0419001-1", "type": "orig", "text": "心所依（hadaya-vatthu）．謂意界及意識界之物質所依．如眼識界等之所依為眼處。曇摩商伽尼等於阿毗曇不明其為何物．於其註釋採用當時一般所用之心臟說．故於此指為心臟．應知。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0420001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0420001", "type": "orig", "text": "不善異熟五識與善異熟五識也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0420001-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0420001-1", "type": "orig", "text": "經路（vithi）．心之現行．謂由眼識等五門起及由意門之起種種。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0420002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0420002", "type": "orig", "text": "本文問分五四五。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0420003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0420003", "type": "orig", "text": "本文問分五五一。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0421001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0421001", "type": "orig", "text": "本文問分五五七。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0421002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0421002", "type": "orig", "text": "四界為地、水、火、風之四大種。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0421003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0421003", "type": "orig", "text": "三根為女根．男根．色命根。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0421004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0421004", "type": "orig", "text": "所依．為心所依（hadaya-vatthu）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0421005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0421005", "type": "orig", "text": "壞色原文為（rūparūpa）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0421001-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0421001-1", "type": "orig", "text": "三地為欲、色、無色。於出世間無唯作心。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0421001-2", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0421001-2", "type": "orig", "text": "「異種性」者．同一有情之有分（及結生死）心．依性類．依地．依所緣．常為同一．則欲界繫善得為色界繫善之修習緣。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0421002-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0421002-1", "type": "orig", "text": "大（mahaggata）．謂色界繫．無色界繫。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0421003-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0421003-1", "type": "orig", "text": "隨順（anuloma）．入定之階梯．進性之前位也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0421004-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0421004-1", "type": "orig", "text": "進姓（gotrabhu）．入定之階梯．由此入於本定也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0422001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0422001", "type": "orig", "text": "本文五七二。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0422001-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0422001-1", "type": "orig", "text": "本文五七九。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0422002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0422002", "type": "orig", "text": "心等起。業等起。時節等起。食等起也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0422001-2", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0422001-2", "type": "orig", "text": "歌羅邏等時期（kalaladikala）．托胎中初期也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0422002-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0422002-1", "type": "orig", "text": "不分離者（avinibbhuta）．暹羅本作 avinibbnuta．PTS 本作 avinibbatta。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0422001-3", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0422001-3", "type": "orig", "text": "piti 雖譯為喜．然在南方則當於興感（interest）之義。somanassa 當為快、愉悅（joy）．somanassa 雖漢譯通例作喜．然欲與南方 piti 區別而用．故以快字譯之。（參照 compendium of philosophy, P. 243.）"}
{"id": null, "n": "0423001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0423001", "type": "orig", "text": "因為貪、瞋、癡之三不善因及無貪、無瞋、無癡之三善因六種．八十九心中．五門向轉．二種五識、領受、推度、建立、發微笑之十八為無因心．餘之七十一為有因心也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0423002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0423002", "type": "orig", "text": "慧（panna）．同於正見。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0423003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0423003", "type": "orig", "text": "尋（vitakka）．此際與正志同。慧乃至定為八聖道。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0423004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0423004", "type": "orig", "text": "PTS 本有云「邪語、邪業、邪命」．參照 Abhidhammatthasangaha, P.33．此中邪志（miccha-sanksppa）通常譯為邪思。在南方如雜阿含 saṅkappa 字為志願．志望之義（compendium of ph. P. 238）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0423005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0423005", "type": "orig", "text": "本文六〇〇。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0423001-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0423001-1", "type": "orig", "text": "身分（kotthasa）．身體自三十二分所成。此中是眼處乃至身處及心所依之六分也。（參照 compenbium of philosophy, p. 206. n. 4）"}
{"id": null, "n": "0423002-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0423002-1", "type": "orig", "text": "本文六〇七。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0423003-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0423003-1", "type": "orig", "text": "本文六〇八。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0423004-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0423004-1", "type": "orig", "text": "本文六〇六。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0423005-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0423005-1", "type": "orig", "text": "謂聖者省察涅槃．異生不省察涅槃。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0423006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0423006", "type": "orig", "text": "本文六〇四。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0423007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0423007", "type": "orig", "text": "本文六〇六。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0423008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0423008", "type": "orig", "text": "三等起身。PTS 本有云四等起身。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0423001-2", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0423001-2", "type": "orig", "text": "本文六一五。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0424002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0424002", "type": "orig", "text": "本文六一五。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0424003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0424003", "type": "orig", "text": "本文六一五。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0424001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0424001", "type": "orig", "text": "緣所生事（paccayupanna-bhava）．雖在暹羅本為paṭupanna-bhāva〔現在之事〕．今從 PTS 本。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0424001-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0424001-1", "type": "orig", "text": "智用（ñāna-cāra）．智之作用也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0424002-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0424002-1", "type": "orig", "text": "雜判別．原文為 pakiṇṇaka-vinicchayo。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0424003-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0424003-1", "type": "orig", "text": "因者．無貪、無瞋、無癡、貪、瞋、癡也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0424004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0424004", "type": "orig", "text": "身輕安等之雙者．心身輕安、心身輕、心身柔軟、心身堪任、心身熟練、心身直性等之諸雙也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0424005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0424005", "type": "orig", "text": "處中性（tatra-majjhata）．對於一切法之中庸者。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0424006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0424006", "type": "orig", "text": "隨喜（muditā）．漢單譯喜。在南方之意．為對於自身之美觀及對於所作善事而喜也。（compendium of philosophy, p. 97, n. 4）"}
{"id": null, "n": "0424007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0424007", "type": "orig", "text": "離（virati）．謂正語、正業、正命之三善心所。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0426001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0426001", "type": "orig", "text": "覺他者 bujjhanaka 於梵語 bodhanaka 相當。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0426002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0426002", "type": "orig", "text": "nayaṁhi ekam~ulako 之譯。「為從因緣耶」等之一緣為根之論法之義也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0428003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0428003", "type": "orig", "text": "法集論初之論母 matikā 也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0428004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0428004", "type": "orig", "text": "「從因緣從所緣緣」者．謂由此緣順論法而分別者。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0428005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0428005", "type": "orig", "text": "發趣論註之序說所云者。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0429001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0429001", "type": "orig", "text": "因緣性（hetupaccayabhāva）者．善安住性義．可參照緣略說分釋因緣處。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0429002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0429002", "type": "orig", "text": "法．本文作蘊。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0429003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0429003", "type": "orig", "text": "指十八種之無因欲界繫異熟心．同唯作心。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0429004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0429004", "type": "orig", "text": "為時節等起色食等起色也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0430005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0430005", "type": "orig", "text": "M. N. I, 265。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0430006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0430006", "type": "orig", "text": "「二相續等起」．謂業等起及時節等起。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0430007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0430007", "type": "orig", "text": "無因唯作心、五門轉向、意門轉向、發微笑．為非修習緣．故除之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0430008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0430008", "type": "orig", "text": "指八種有因欲界繫唯作心．五種色界繫唯作心．四種無色界繫唯作心。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0430009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0430009", "type": "orig", "text": "括弧內暹羅本缺．從 PTS 本補之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0430010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0430010", "type": "orig", "text": "「經路心」vithicitta 者．有分心斷．從心現行至再於有分沒也。此處所言．為善、不善及唯作證之三也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0431001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0431001", "type": "orig", "text": "PTS 本「得非增上」．亦可。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0431002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0431002", "type": "orig", "text": "指時節等起色．業等起色。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0431003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0431003", "type": "orig", "text": "指時節等起色．食等起色。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0431004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0431004", "type": "orig", "text": "指無因欲界繫異熟及同唯作。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0431005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0431005", "type": "orig", "text": "指時節等起色及食等起色。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0431001-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0431001-1", "type": "orig", "text": "「一切處緣」（Sabbatthanika-paccaya）．處者因也。謂使色一切色．非法生之緣也。應閱緣廣說釋雜判別之八。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0431002-1", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0431002-1", "type": "orig", "text": "非色處緣者．唯使非色法生之緣．即所緣、所緣增上、無間、等無間、無間親依止、本性親依止、前生、修習、相應、無有、去緣也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0431001-2", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0431001-2", "type": "orig", "text": "所緣、無間、等無間、〔前生、修習〕、相應、有、無、去之九緣。參照緣廣說末雜判別。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0432002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0432002", "type": "orig", "text": "五門轉向心。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0432003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0432003", "type": "orig", "text": "意門轉向心及與喜俱之微心。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0433001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0433001", "type": "orig", "text": "「有所緣法」（Sarammana-dhamma）者．為非色之四蘊。何以故．心法無所緣則不生起故也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0435001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0435001", "type": "orig", "text": "眼、耳、鼻、舌、身之五根與色、聲、香、味及地、火、風。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0437001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0437001", "type": "orig", "text": "參照本文四八四至四八六。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0437002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0437002", "type": "orig", "text": "參照本文四八七至四九五。善對於善、不善、無記．不善對於不善、善、無記．無記對於無記、善、不善為九。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0437003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0437003", "type": "orig", "text": "參照本文四九六至五〇四。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0437004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0437004", "type": "orig", "text": "參照本文五〇五至五一一。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0438005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0438005", "type": "orig", "text": "若完全書之．應為 nissa-yaupanissaya-adhipati。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0438006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0438006", "type": "orig", "text": "貪、瞋、癡之三不善因．無貪、無瞋、無癡之三善因．無貪、無瞋、無癡之三無記因。參照因緣廣說分釋。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0440001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0440001", "type": "orig", "text": "此處依 PTS 本．暹羅本則由是以上問分之緣不可得．“ito uddham pannhāvārapaccaya nalabbhanti”。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0441002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0441002", "type": "orig", "text": "暹羅版 PTS 本．皆云 na labbhantiti na vattā．然觀本文相當處前之 na 應為誤插入也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0426002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0426002", "type": "mod", "text": "nayaṁhi ekam~ulako 之譯。「為從因緣耶」等之一緣為根之論法之義也。（CBETA 按：大藏經補編原書有註解條目[02]，但此頁缺相對應之註標，故今於此處加上[02]之註標。）"}
{"id": null, "n": "0435001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0435001", "type": "mod", "text": "眼、耳、鼻、舌、身之五根與色、聲、香、味及地、火、風。（CBETA 按：大藏經補編原書有註解條目[01]，但此頁缺相對應之註標，故 今於此處加上[01]之註標。）"}
